   {
    "statement": "On Switch Lite, pins 8 and 17 reading OL on a T-824 USB-C reader is normal (no video out, so no PI3USB).",
    "evidence": "Diagnostic steps.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "With an original charger the meter should show 15 V; only 5 V means M92T36 isn't negotiating—check its caps, then replace it. Last resort: BQ24193.",
    "evidence": "Diagnostic steps.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   },
   {
    "statement": "Beware fake M92T36 chips from disreputable sellers.",
    "evidence": "Note.",
    "quote": "",
    "at": ""
   }
  ],
  "procedure": [
   "Try a new battery and charger.",
   "Inspect port; read it with a T-824.",
   "Check the USB-C fuse.",
   "Check negotiation (15 V); replace M92T36; then BQ24193.",
   "Test both cable orientations."
